-1,"We spoke on the phone yesterday.","Vakar kalbėjomės telefonu.",1],[0,"Yes, of course. Come on in!","Taip, žinoma. Užeikite!","ce0eb70041bb",1.84],[0,"So, this is the living room, and the kitchen is on the right.","Taigi, čia svetainė, o virtuvė – dešinėje.","6bfa4849924f",3.86],[0,"Any pets?","Gyvūnų turite?","6dc487c1010c",0.99],[-1,"No, I don't have any pets.","Ne, gyvūnų neturiu.",1],[0,"Okay.","Gerai.","e78a32e61873",0.58],[0,"So, what would you like to know?","Tai ką norėtumėte sužinoti?","a183c24ac9bb",1.55],[-1,"Where's the laundry room?","Kur yra skalbykla?",1],[0,"There's a laundry room in the basement.","Rūsyje yra skalbykla.","7b0b2cbe9aec",2.02],[0,"What else can I tell you?","Ką dar galiu Jums papasakoti?","92654b4f76c2",1.13],[-1,"Is there a bus stop nearby?","Ar netoliese yra autobusų stotelė?",1],[0,"It's a two-minute walk to the bus stop.","Iki autobusų stotelės – dvi minutės pėsčiomis.","f0408da039f0",1.9],[0,"Anything else you'd like to know?","Ar dar ką nors norėtumėte sužinoti?","008d92bf0a08",1.25],[-1,"How much is the rent?","Kiek kainuoja nuoma?",1],[0,"The rent is fourteen hundred dollars a month.","Nuoma – 1 400 dolerių per mėnesį.","c0d5a6ba4600",2.37],[0,"Any other questions?","Dar klausimų turite?","47d4b54ebddd",1.04],[-1,"Is it furnished?","Ar butas su baldais?",1],[0,"Good question.","Geras klausimas.","b7ec1b93d3d7",0.77],[0,"No, it's unfurnished. But all the appliances are new.","Ne, butas be baldų. Bet visa buitinė technika nauja.","11eb4522d648",3.17],[-1,"When is the rent due?","Iki kada reikia sumokėti nuomą?",1],[0,"Rent is due on the first of the month.","Nuoma mokama kiekvieno mėnesio pirmąją dieną.","594b83533f9b",2.11],[-1,"Is there parking?","Ar yra kur pastatyti automobilį?",1],[0,"Yes, there's free parking behind the building.","Taip, už pastato yra nemokama stovėjimo aikštelė.","4dc85ff25d41",2.61],[-1,"Is electricity included?","Ar elektra įskaičiuota?",1],[0,"No, electricity isn't included.","Ne, elektra neįskaičiuota.","6828d8132754",2.23],[0,"You'd pay for it separately.","Už ją mokėtumėte atskirai.","9e79d996a715",1.55],[-1,"I'll take it!","Imsiu!",1],[0,"Great! I'm glad you like it.","Puiku! Džiaugiuosi, kad butas Jums patinka.","d0db800a6cdd",1.88],[0,"Just so you know:","Kad žinotumėte:","7628a99432b6",0.85],[0,"The security deposit is one month's rent.","Garantinis užstatas – vieno mėnesio nuoma.","902c3c7478c7",2.6],[0,"The lease is for twelve months.","Sutartis sudaroma dvylikai mėnesių.","aead42fae3be",2.05],[0,"So, when are you looking to move in?","Tai kada planuojate įsikelti?","6bb320cc9f07",1.83],[-1,"Next month, if possible.","Kitą mėnesį, jei įmanoma.",1],[0,"That works.","Tinka.","a6cee7d713d0",0.74],[0,"You can move in on the first of the month.","Įsikelti galėsite mėnesio pirmąją.","13e236912fd5",2.18],[0,"So, here's the lease. Just sign here, please.","Taigi, štai sutartis. Tiesiog pasirašykite čia.","0e7af29694ae",3.24],[-1,"Sure. Where do I sign?","Žinoma. Kur pasirašyti?",1],[0,"Right here, at the bottom.","Štai čia, apačioje.","549822a14377",1.67],[0,"And here are your keys. Welcome home!","O štai Jūsų raktai. Sveiki atvykę į naujus namus!","2b603dd6a90d",2.13],[0,"If you need anything, I live on the first floor.","Jei ko prireiks, aš gyvenu pirmame aukšte.","9004ef51e829",2.38],[0,"Hello! Can I help you?","Sveiki! Kuo galiu padėti?","4c2b7b27add5",1.44],[-1,"My name is Tomas.","Mano vardas – Tomas.",1],[0,"Nice to meet you!","Malonu susipažinti!","5f10e725e653",0.99],[0,"Are you here about the apartment?","Jūs dėl buto?","caaf7d662a0d",1.55],[-1,"No, I'm good, thanks.","Ne, man nereikia, ačiū.",1],[0,"Oh, sorry! How can I help you?","O, atsiprašau! Kuo galiu padėti?","f7a1dfa108d3",1.71],[-1,"Hi, I'm here to see the apartment.","Sveiki, atėjau apžiūrėti buto.",1],[0,"Come on in!","Užeikite!","bf80bf6feec7",0.69],[0,"This is the living room. The bedroom is at the end of the hall.","Čia svetainė. Miegamasis – koridoriaus gale.","1a0e15acd69f",3.42],[0,"The apartment is very bright.","Butas labai šviesus.","e331c44b78fd",1.98],[0,"When would you like to move in?","Kada norėtumėte įsikelti?","6d02a77b26ad",1.31],[-1,"On the first, if possible.","Nuo mėnesio pirmosios, jei įmanoma.",1],[0,"Perfect.","Puiku.","b391883dc173",0.57],[0,"Will it be just you?","Gyvensite viena?","90be9694b337",1.34],[-1,"Me and my family.","Aš ir mano šeima.",1],[0,"Do you have any pets?","Ar turite gyvūnų?","57b7b9099078",1.49],[0,"Sure.","Žinoma.","958d9a25ad23",0.65],[0,"Do you have any questions?","Ar turite klausimų?","30a33d4c995b",1.43],[-1,"No, that's all, thanks.","Ne, tai viskas, ačiū.",1],[0,"Oh, and by the way:","O, beje:","c15d8a3d5f4b",1.25],[0,"Heat and water are included. You'd pay for electricity and internet.","Šildymas ir vanduo įskaičiuoti. Už elektrą ir internetą mokėtumėte patys.","0a23ff900e9e",4.08],[0,"Well, what do you think of the apartment?","Na, ką manote apie butą?","88eb57d9b37b",1.82],[-1,"Can I let you know tomorrow?","Ar galėčiau Jums pranešti rytoj?",1],[0,"Sure, no problem. Here's my number.","Žinoma. Štai mano numeris.","5f2fc616b4b2",2.36],[0,"Hope to hear from you soon!","Tikiuosi, greitai susisieksite!","dbf630f298e2",1.2],[0,"Hi there! Can I help you with something?","Sveiki! Ar galiu kuo nors padėti?","7f6546623d56",1.7],[-1,"Is the apartment still available?","Ar butas dar laisvas?",1],[0,"Yes, it is! Come on in.","Taip, laisvas! Užeikite.","db57cc77eef3",1.81],[0,"The kitchen is brand new.","Virtuvė visiškai nauja.","b416f960a3a4",1.47],[-1,"As soon as possible.","Kuo greičiau.",1],[0,"Is it just for you?","Ar butas tik Jums?","f3fd26ba87e1",1.14],[-1,"It's just me.","Gyvensiu viena.",1],[0,"Wonderful! I think you'll be very happy here.","Nuostabu! Manau, Jums čia labai patiks.","93b25dfb9451",2.83],[0,"Water and heat, yes. Electricity and internet, no.","Vanduo ir šildymas – taip. Elektra ir internetas – ne.","6a702263e5c2",3.84],[0,"First, can I see your ID, please?","Pirmiausia, ar galėčiau pamatyti Jūsų asmens dokumentą?","34e7a5db31ac",2.16],[-1,"Is a passport okay?","Ar tiks pasas?",1],[0,"A passport is fine.","Pasas tinka.","fd69b0a7f704",1.18],[0,"Here's the lease. Please sign at the bottom.","Štai sutartis. Prašom pasirašyti apačioje.","68f769136633",2.49],[-1,"Sure, thanks!","Žinoma, ačiū!",1],[0,"Hi! You must be here about the apartment.","Sveiki! Jūs turbūt dėl buto?","497f4c3f1d4e",2.36],[-1,"Is there an elevator?","Ar yra liftas?",1],[0,"There's no elevator, just the stairs.","Lifto nėra, tik laiptai.","7c1880520367",2.28],[-1,"Are utilities included?","Ar komunaliniai mokesčiai įskaičiuoti?",1],[-1,"Can I see the bedroom?","Ar galiu pamatyti miegamąjį?",1],[0,"Of course! Follow me.","Žinoma! Eikite paskui mane.","2277a3725b29",1.49],[0,"The washers and dryers are in the basement.","Skalbimo mašinos ir džiovyklės – rūsyje.","1d53d475648b",2.44],[0,"You get one parking space behind the building.","Jums priklauso viena stovėjimo vieta už pastato.","c6c369723dd9",2.46],[0,"It's fourteen hundred a month.","1 400 dolerių per mėnesį.","b3e5dd468c96",1.69],[-1,"When can I move in?","Kada galėčiau įsikelti?",1],[0,"I'll need your ID and a letter from your employer.","Man reikės Jūsų asmens dokumento ir pažymos iš darbdavio.","a97b9248552d",2.86],[-1,"Here's my passport.","Štai mano pasas.",1],[0,"Perfect, thank you.","Puiku, ačiū.","a382ad327e59",1.31],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[-1,"I'd like to see the apartment, please.","Norėčiau pamatyti butą.",1],[0,"Great, come on in!","Puiku, užeikite!","95aba714af4c",1.46],[0,"No, it's unfurnished, but the kitchen has a fridge, a stove and a dishwasher.","Ne, butas be baldų, bet virtuvėje yra šaldytuvas, viryklė ir indaplovė.","a0c4c127fa52",4.99],[-1,"Could you lower the rent a little?","Ar galėtumėte truputį sumažinti nuomą?",1],[0,"I'm afraid the price is fixed. But heat and water are included.","Deja, kaina fiksuota. Bet šildymas ir vanduo įskaičiuoti.","9cc69d35dc81",4.01],[0,"The bus stop is right on the corner.","Autobusų stotelė – visai prie kampo.","79097a26b91d",1.78],[-1,"I think that's all.","Manau, tai viskas.",1],[0,"So, what do you think?","Tai ką manote?","8ce095ffb5b0",1.21],[-1,"I need to think about it.","Turiu pagalvoti.",1],[0,"That's fine. Just call me by Friday.","Gerai. Tiesiog paskambinkite man iki penktadienio.","fa964d0f168b",2.08],[-1,"I'm here about the apartment for rent.","Atėjau dėl nuomojamo buto.",1],[0,"So, are you interested?","Tai ar Jus domina?","28e9dfc76514",1.4],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[0,"No problem. Good luck with your search!","Jokių problemų. Sėkmės ieškant buto!","8471a7d41468",2.12],[-1,"That would be great, thanks.","Būtų puiku, ačiū.",1],[-1,"I'd like to rent it.","Norėčiau jį išsinuomoti.",1],[0,"Okay, great.","Gerai, puiku.","314fb441593d",1.05],[-1,"I don't think it's right for me.","Nemanau, kad jis man tinka.",1],[0,"I understand. Thanks for coming!","Suprantu. Ačiū, kad atėjote!","53848fd948a3",1.82],[0,"Sure, take your time.","Žinoma, neskubėkite.","8d832790ee92",1.53],[-1,"It's a little too expensive for me.","Man jis kiek per brangus.",1],[0,"Sorry, the rent is firm. But heat and water are included.","Atsiprašau, dėl nuomos nesiderame. Bet šildymas ir vanduo įskaičiuoti.","1841a824fa6e",3.79],[0,"Of course. Take your time.","Žinoma. Neskubėkite.","3240fe3b8db4",1.43],[0,"That's great, thanks.","Puiku, ačiū.","3ba50263e9cb",1.24]],"contexts":[{"visits":3,"seed":1},{"sim":2,"visits":0,"seed":3},{"visits":3,"seed":2},{"sim":1,"visits":0,"seed":2},{"visits":2,"seed":1},{"sim":0,"visits":0,"seed":1},{"visits":1,"seed":2},{"sim":3,"visits":0,"seed":4},{"visits":2,"seed":2},{"visits":1,"seed":1},{"visits":0,"seed":2},{"visits":0,"seed":1}],"replies":["purpose/3","pets/0","ask_terms/9","ask_more/1","ask_terms/0","ask_terms/5","ask_more/5","ask_terms/8","ask_terms/4","done_asking/2","movein/1","sign/0","purpose/5","g_yesno/3","purpose/0","movein/0","people/1","done_asking/1","decide/4","purpose/4","mo